# cross-check: https://mtg.wiki/page/Shandalar_Enemy_Decks_(Arzakon) — "Arzakon's Deck"
#   (Original) [Tier-web — maindeck agrees]
# cross-check: a screenshot of the 1997 .DCK file is on the wiki (files.mtg.wiki Arzakon_Shandalar.png)
# group: 1997 originals
